        "fail_code": "FORCE_READONLY_MUTATOR",
        "coverage": null,
        "notes": "Cannot claim inescapable runtime with break-glass open under default failHard"
      },
      "derivation": "§1.5 + §3: forceReadonly on mutator heuristic + failHard true ⇒ throw"
    },
